id: pmc-no-empty-unreleased-337
title: Verify and complete empty Unreleased suppression for issue 337
description: "Track issue 337: include-empty retains versioned release sections only; never render an empty Unreleased section in replace, prepend, stdout, or check. Verify real pending-write, commit, tag, post-tag-check sequences and retain nonempty notes. Related earlier work: pmc-stable-itemless-check; this item owns the exact issue 337 regression proof and remaining mode gaps."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-changelog#337"
created_at: "2026-11-10T23:00:03.696Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-10T23:12:37.030Z"
assignee: codex-changelog337
claim_principal: codex-changelog337
author: codex-changelog337
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-10T23:00:05.874Z",codex-changelog337,"Orientation counts: context reports 216 total items, 13 active (10 open, 3 in_progress), 200 closed, 3 canceled; returned focus 10 with omissions. Open list returned all 10 open items. Exact issue tag search returned 0; keyword searches returned 10 of 65 and 10 of 58. Earlier issue 333 already merged the core visibility filter and documented the policy. This item tracks issue 337 specifically and will verify actual CLI publication sequences plus stale prepend input, without weakening existing tests."
  "2026-11-10T23:01:04.309Z",codex-changelog337,"Confirmed remaining runtime gap: prepend merges keep a legacy empty Unreleased placeholder when the versioned release already exists, and also when no releases are generated. Plan: remove only whitespace-only or literal No changes. pending bodies while merging; preserve meaningful pending prose/dependencies. Keep the merged issue 333 generation filter. Add real-Git writer/commit/tag/check cases for empty, Dependabot-only and released-item windows with both include-empty settings; add per-mode migration and later-item guards. No existing test asserting an empty block needs changing."
  "2026-11-10T23:04:45.793Z",codex-changelog337,"Implementation retains the existing generation filter and cleans legacy empty pending blocks during prepend merge, including the no-generated-release case. Added nine regression tests with real Git publication fixtures and source CLI subprocesses. Initial new-fixture runs exposed expected category naming and the separate requested-release extraction guard; fixtures now retain a real released item in later-work controls so both include-empty settings exercise nonempty Unreleased rather than unrelated missing-release refusals. Existing tests remain unchanged. Typecheck, test compilation, build and docstring lint passed; docstring lint read 47 files and 268 declarations. Linked runner was retried with its supported default schema context after none/source context was refused."
  "2026-11-10T23:06:35.200Z",codex-changelog337,"Linked regression command passed 9/9 with zero failed/skipped in 88.8 seconds via pm test --run --progress. Test-result-tracking is disabled in repository settings, so this comment preserves the receipt without changing policy. npm run changelog:full regenerated CHANGELOG.md and npm run changelog:check passed, including item links. Final docstring lint read 48 files and 268 declarations. Regression tests exercise both include-empty settings, read-only checks, pre-tag/post-tag byte identity, three output modes, legacy migration, later items and later dependency entries."
  "2026-11-10T23:11:09.357Z",codex-changelog337,"Revert proof so far: timeout 1200 node scripts/prove-empty-unreleased-revert.ts runs only in a disposable copy. Baseline passed 9/9. Restoring the pre-issue-333 include-empty visibility branch failed 8/9: all three publication windows, replace/prepend/stdout tagged-HEAD checks, later-item and later-dependency guards. Reverting this PR prepend cleanup failed 2/9: prepend migration and normalized/empty-only cleanup. Dropping nonempty Unreleased failed both later-work guards (2/9). Dropping dependency-only sections failed Dependabot publication and later-dependency preservation (2/9). This distinguishes the already-merged generation fix from this PR remaining prepend fix. Final restored run is pending."
  "2026-11-10T23:12:37.029Z",codex-changelog337,"Completed revert proof: timeout 1200 node scripts/prove-empty-unreleased-revert.ts exited 0. Baseline 9/9 passed; restore-empty-Unreleased-visibility failed 8, revert-prepend-cleanup failed 2, drop-nonempty-Unreleased failed 2, drop-dependency-only-sections failed 2; final restored run passed 9/9. All failures were assertion failures in the expected named regression tests. Across the new file, eight test cases use eleven real temporary Git repositories and twenty-two real release tags; the ninth tests normalized legacy headings and no-generated-release cleanup. No existing tests changed. Documentation and regenerated changelog explicitly note callers lose the empty block on their next regeneration."
